<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:03:54 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>三岁男孩的转移性癌症在两次实验性细胞疗法后消失</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/three-year-old-boys-metastatic-cancer-disappears-after-two-shots-of-experimental-cell-therapy</link><description>这个男孩的肝癌已经扩散到肺部，没有出现任何危险的副作用，一年后仍然没有癌症。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/three-year-old-boys-metastatic-cancer-disappears-after-two-shots-of-experimental-cell-therapy2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:03:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/three-year-old-boys-metastatic-cancer-disappears-after-two-shots-of-experimental-cell-therapy</guid></item><item><title>大脑如何决定在何处对其自身线路进行绝缘</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-the-brain-decides-where-to-insulate-its-own-wiring</link><description>生物学家揭示神经元在引导髓磷脂到达特定位置方面“有发言权” &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-the-brain-decides-where-to-insulate-its-own-wiring.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:48:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-the-brain-decides-where-to-insulate-its-own-wiring</guid></item><item><title>AI能感觉到疼痛吗？它至少可以像它那样</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/can-an-ai-feel-pain-it-can-at-least-act-like-it-does</link><description>“新的尖端人工智能 (AI) 模型能感觉到疼痛吗？根据最近的一项研究，它们至少表现得好像能感觉到疼痛。通过深入研究内部工作原理公开的 25 个人工智能模型，研究人员发现了一种与疼痛概念特别相关的活动模式。更重要的是，当有机会时，一些人工智能会关闭这种模式，作为一种‘缓解疼痛’的形式。” &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/can-an-ai-feel-pain-it-can-at-least-act-like-it-does2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:33:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/can-an-ai-feel-pain-it-can-at-least-act-like-it-does</guid></item><item><title>世界因提出问题而改变</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-world-is-transformed-by-asking-questions</link><description>早在 2013 年，我就写道，当我们停止提出问题的那一刻，我们就变成了愚蠢的机器人。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-world-is-transformed-by-asking-questions2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:18:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-world-is-transformed-by-asking-questions</guid></item><item><title>让人类控制人工智能的蓝图</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-blueprint-for-keeping-humans-in-control-of-ai</link><description>尽管奥弗曼开始将人工智能用于他的研究，但他对这项技术的发展方向越来越警惕。 “这不仅关系到可能发生的世界末日的可能性；我还对人类繁荣的未来进行了很多思考，”奥弗曼说。他担心，失调的人工智能可能会超越其界限（不一定是恶意的），并对人类造成微妙但真正的伤害。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-blueprint-for-keeping-humans-in-control-of-ai.jpg" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:03:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-blueprint-for-keeping-humans-in-control-of-ai</guid></item><item><title>去除一种小胶质细胞蛋白可预防 NeuroHIV 脑损伤</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/removing-one-microglial-protein-prevented-neurohiv-brain-injury</link><description>研究人员从神经 HIV 模型中的小胶质细胞中去除了 MAPK14/p38α，发现脑损伤和记忆缺陷得到了预防，从而将信号蛋白确定为限制 HIV 神经系统并发症的潜在靶点。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/removing-one-microglial-protein-prevented-neurohiv-brain-injury.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:48:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/removing-one-microglial-protein-prevented-neurohiv-brain-injury</guid></item><item><title>在这个游戏中，你必须根据记忆在地图上画出边界线</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/in-this-game-you-have-to-draw-border-lines-from-memory-on-a-map</link><description>你可以免费玩！ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/in-this-game-you-have-to-draw-border-lines-from-memory-on-a-map.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:33:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/in-this-game-you-have-to-draw-border-lines-from-memory-on-a-map</guid></item><item><title>尝试这个用于虚幻引擎 5 电影的电影模拟工具</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/try-this-film-emulation-tool-for-unreal-engine-5-cinematics</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:18:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/try-this-film-emulation-tool-for-unreal-engine-5-cinematics</guid></item><item><title>预测高亮度大型强子对撞机的经济影响</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/predicting-the-economic-impact-of-the-high-luminosity-lhc</link><description>几十年来的中微子之谜可能不是通过未被发现的物理学来解决，而是通过改进的计算来解决。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/predicting-the-economic-impact-of-the-high-luminosity-lhc.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:03:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/predicting-the-economic-impact-of-the-high-luminosity-lhc</guid></item><item><title>宇宙锁定：环境如何隔离量子场</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cosmic-lockdown-how-the-environment-can-isolate-quantum-fields</link><description>一个简化的宇宙学模型表明，退相干可以抑制量子隧道效应，有效地将场锁定到它们所达到的真空状态。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cosmic-lockdown-how-the-environment-can-isolate-quantum-fields2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:48:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cosmic-lockdown-how-the-environment-can-isolate-quantum-fields</guid></item></channel></rss>